flowchart TB
    T1[claude-sidecar-skeleton<br/>Entrypoint + Command Parser + Output Writer<br/>纯协议层无 SDK]:::p0

    T2[claude-sidecar-sdk-bridge<br/>SDK 客户端封装 + 多 run 复用]:::p1
    T3[claude-sidecar-translator<br/>SDK Message → SidecarEvent + 状态跟踪 + 去重]:::p1

    T4[claude-sidecar-approval<br/>can_use_tool 异步对接 + deny 去重]:::p2
    T5[claude-sidecar-lifecycle<br/>interrupt + reconnect + shutdown]:::p2

    T6[claude-sidecar-error-handling<br/>横切错误时机]:::p3
    T7[claude-sidecar-test-suite<br/>单元 + smoke 回归 + mock driver]:::p3

    T1 --> T2
    T1 --> T3
    T2 --> T4
    T2 --> T5
    T3 --> T4
    T2 --> T6
    T3 --> T6
    T4 --> T7
    T5 --> T7
    T6 --> T7

